# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible.
#
# .git is deliberately NOT excluded: Go reads it to stamp vcs.revision into the binary, which
# is what /healthz reports as its version. Excluding it makes every deployed build report
# itself as "dev" — the exact failure the builder installs git to avoid.

web/
node_modules/
bin/
docs/
tests/
*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vscode/
.github/
coverage.out
cover.out
*.test
